---
source: src/args.rs
expression: help
---
Usage: arkivisto [OPTIONS] [MODE]

Arguments:
  [MODE]
          Processing mode [default: single] [possible values: scan, process, archive, single]

Options:
  -l, --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>
          Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn, error]
      --fake-scan
          Dev mode: Don't actually scan, but use simulated scan TIFFs
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
